# UI change verification

When editing dashboard HTML/CSS/HTMX, dashboard routes, or `:frontend-js`
charts/DOM: verify viewport, CSS cache-busting, interactions, visuals, and the
settings-backed mode plate before calling done or opening a PR.

Full guidance: [`.agents/OPERATING.md` § 5 UI change verification](../../.agents/OPERATING.md).
